[9237]="7003E2F5\n1\tDefeat Naethír\tNaethír can be found in the central Fields of Fornost, north of the road leading west towards Evendim. You should defeat Naethír, for this being has sapped the warmth from the Fields of Fornost.\n2\tDefeat Naethír\tNaethír can be found in the central Fields of Fornost, north of the road leading west towards Evendim. You should defeat Naethír, for this being has sapped the warmth from the Fields of Fornost.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated one of the chief forces of evil in the Fields of Fornost.\n",
[9238]="7001925D\n1\tDefeat lizards in Nalâ-dûm (total: 25)\tNalâ-dûm, where the Water-wheels lie still, is below the Chamber of the Cross-roads in the Water-works. Dór wishes for you to defeat lizards around the Water-wheels because of the damage they must wreak upon Nalâ-dûm. He warned that you should take a friend or two with you.\n2\tTalk to Dór\tDór is at the Chamber of the Cross-roads, awaiting news of your venture into Nalâ-dûm. You should return to Dór and tell him of your success against the lizards around the Water-wheels.\n",
[9239]="7001925E\n1\tCollect rock-worm scales in Nalâ-dûm (total: 4)\tThe scales can be found on the skins of worms in Nalâ-dûm, below the Chamber of the Cross-roads in the Water-works. You should collect scales while in Nalâ-dûm for the dwarves to tailor into their armour. This will strengthen their defences significantly.\n2\tBring the worm-scales to Dór\tDór is north of Nalâ-dûm, in the Chamber of the Cross-roads in Durin's Way. You should bring the scales to Dór so that he may begin to craft better armour for the dwarves of the expedition.\n",
[9240]="7001925C\n1\tDefeat the menace in Nalâ-dûm\tNalâ-dûm, where the Water-wheels lie still, is far below of the Chamber of the Cross-roads in the Water-works of Moria. Dór has asked you to travel to Nalâ-dûm and defeat the menace that lurks deep inside that forsaken hall. He warned you to take a friend or two with you.\n2\tTalk to Dór at the Chamber of the Cross-roads\tDór is at the Chamber of the Cross-roads in Moria, above Nalâ-dûm in Durin's Way. You should return to Dór and tell him of the Caerog you bested, thus removing the menace of the Water-wheels.\n",
[9241]="70055926\n1\tFind the entrance to the Wracking-hall\tThe Wracking-hall can be found in the eastern reaches of the Circle of Death. Maendal has asked you to search the Wracking-hall for signs of a terrible nameless creature and defeat it.\n2\tEnter the Wracking-hall\tThe Wracking-hall can be found in the eastern reaches of the Circle of Death. You have discovered the Wracking-hall and should now enter it.\n3\tSearch for the Gnawing One in the Wracking-hall\tThe Wracking-hall can be found in the eastern reaches of the Circle of Death. Maendal has asked you to find the greatest of the nameless creatures in the Wracking-hall and defeat it.\n4\tExamine the sacrificed Orc\tThe Wracking-hall can be found in the eastern reaches of the Circle of Death. You have discovered a freshly-slain Orc on an offering table within the Wracking-hall. You should examine it and see if it was meant to appease the Gnawing One.\n5\tTalk to Maendal at Uialrond\tMaendal can be found outside Uialrond in the Circle of Death. You have defeated the Gnawing One and prevented more nameless creatures from gnawing into the foundations of Minas Morgul. You should return to Maendal.\n",
[9242]="7005AAB6\n1\tDefeat hobgoblin nest-tenders (total: 5)\tHobgoblin nest-tenders can be found in the drake-nest of Borkordh in the south-east side of the Pit of Stonejaws.\n2\tTalk to Molkha outside Borkordh\tMolkha is scouting outside Borkordh.\n",
[9243]="7004962C\n1\tDefeat Regmyl and destroy shrines to Borangos\tNargroth is located in Talath Úrui. You should defeat Regmyl and destroy shrines to Borangos.\n2\tDefeat Regmyl in Nargroth (total: 8)\030Destroy shrines to Borangos (total: 6)\tNargroth is located in Talath Úrui. You should defeat Regmyl and destroy shrines to Borangos.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated many Regmyl and destroyed shrines to Borangos.\n",
[9244]="70048C99\n1\tDestroy plague-fly nests (total: 10)\030Defeat swarming plague-flies (total: 10)\tSwarming plague-flies and their nests can be found in the wilds of Agarnaith. You should destroy swarming plague-flies and plague-fly nests.\n2\tDestroy norbog nests (total: 5)\030Defeat plague-ridden nerbyg (total: 10)\tPlague-ridden nerbyg and their nests can be found in the wilds of Agarnaith. You should destroy plague-ridden nerbyg and norbog nests.\n3\tDestroy ash-claw dens (total: 5)\030Defeat plagued ash-claws (total: 10)\tPlagued ash-claws and their dens can be found in the wilds of Agarnaith. You should destroy plagued ash-claws and ash-claw dens.\n4\tTalk to Viznak\tViznak can be found in his hideout. You should talk to Viznak.\n",
[9245]="700017D2\n1\tDefeat Wargs at Nathan Hodges' Farm (total: 10)\tNathan Hodges' Farm can be found east along the road from Amon Raith in the North Downs. You should go to Nathan Hodges' Farm and ensure that it is free of Wargs.\n2\tTell Nathan Hodges the farm has been cleared of Wargs\tNathan Hodges is at Amon Raith. You should tell Nathan Hodges that his farm is now safe from the Wargs.\n",
[9246]="70059775\n1\tFind Natsulm the Night-raider\tNatsulm the Night-raider can be found in the Wildwood. You should find Natsulm the Night-raider.\n2\tDefeat Natsulm the Night-raider\tNatsulm the Night-raider can be found in the Wildwood. You should defeat Natsulm the Night-raider.\n",
[9247]="70046BFB\n1\tCollect toad-slime from shimmering river-toads (total: 8)\tShimmering river-toads can be found along the shores of various streams and ponds in North Ithilien, especially to the north-east of Henneth Annûn. Rhadrog has asked you to defeat toads in North Ithilien and harvest their slime for use by the Rangers.\n2\tTalk to Rhadrog\tRhadrog can be found in Henneth Annûn. You have carefully gathered a great deal of toad-slime and should now return to Rhadrog.\n3\tUse the Rangers' workbench to coat arrowheads in slime (quantity: see journal)\tWorkbenches can be found within the deepest caverns of Henneth Annûn. You have gathered phials of toad-slime and should now use it to coat arrow-heads for the Rangers of Ithilien.\n4\tTalk to Rhadrog\tRhadrog can be found in Henneth Annûn. You have coated many arrow-heads in toad-slime and should now report back to Rhadrog.\n",
[9248]="7001AA7A\n1\tCollect glowing glands (total: 6)\tFireflies can be found throughout Emyn Lûm. Lomdognir has asked you to hunt down the fireflies in Emyn Lûm and attempt to collect a handful of the glands that produce a glow, which can cast a light even through the mists enshrouding Mirkwood.\n2\tTalk to Lomdognir at Ost Galadh\tLomdognir is at Ost Galadh. You should return to Lomdognir with the firefly-glands which you have collected.\n",
